#: ../../../source/Releases/Humble-Hawksbill-Complete-Changelog.rst:1728
#: ../../../source/Releases/Humble-Hawksbill-Complete-Changelog.rst:1819
msgid ""
"Add in callback_groups_for_each. The main reason to add this method in is to "
"make accesses to the callback_groups\\_ vector thread-safe.  By having a "
"callback_groups_for_each that accepts a std::function, we can just have the "
"callers give us the callback they are interested in, and we can take care of "
"the locking. The rest of this fairly large PR is cleaning up all of the "
"places that use get_callback_groups() to instead use "
"callback_groups_for_each()."
msgstr ""

